                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/7166: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-03-10T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 10,
                                1926—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>57. Your telegram No. 119, March 9, 9 p.m. Attitude proposed by you in paragraph
                    3 is approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
